  "markdown": "Material family\n\n# Acoustic wallcoverings\n\nA textured face over an acoustic construction, or an acoustic panel.\n\n![Cinema room walls in a dark Elitis acoustic wallcovering, private residence, Mayfair.](https://www.mrwallcover.com/media/img/r/brand-elitis-01-800.webp)\n\nElitis wallcovering installed in a private cinema room in Mayfair. This records the face and the installation; acoustic performance is established by the exact system’s documents.Mr Wallcover project photograph, March 2018.[Our installation record](https://www.instagram.com/p/BglmE0vgCj9/)\n\nBefore you choose\n\n**Consider it when**\n: Sound performance forms part of a professionally specified system.\n\n**The trade-off**\n: A decorative texture is not evidence of acoustic performance.\n\n**Before ordering**\n: Obtain the exact system data, installation detail and project acceptance.\n\n01 · The finish\n\n## Joins\n\nEdges, trims and cuts have to keep the system the way it was specified.\n\n02 · The setting\n\n## Where it belongs\n\nRooms where sound was part of the specification\n\n03 · Installation\n\n## Handling\n\nAdhesive, trimming and edges follow the instruction for that system. The material light studio does not show acoustic performance.\n\n04 · Living with it\n\n## Care\n\nFollow the system maker. We do not claim a decorative finish is an acoustic rating.\n\nDigital colour is a guide. Order a cutting or a sample before you commit to a room. Some makers’ own sample routes are listed under [official buying routes](https://www.mrwallcover.com/buying-routes/). We can install material you have already bought, or source a family and install it. Either way, the next step is a short note about the room.\n\nBefore you order\n\n## For a high-value order\n\n- Workmanship is guaranteed for twelve months. [The aftercare page](https://www.mrwallcover.com/aftercare/) sets out what is covered.\n- Public liability, employers' liability and professional indemnity details are available on request.\n- Risk assessments and method statements (RAMS) on every job, with Dorin Burcus supervising on site.\n- A core team of six wallpaper hangers and six decorators who work together every day, scaling to 25–35 skilled tradespeople for large hotel programmes.\n- [For designers and architects](https://www.mrwallcover.com/professionals/designers/)\n- [Download the specification schedule (CSV)](https://www.mrwallcover.com/downloads/wallcovering-specification-schedule.csv)\n- [Trade and contractors](https://www.mrwallcover.com/trade/)\n\nIllustrative material study · confirm the actual finish with a sample\n\nPause motion\n\nSave to shortlist\n\nSaved on this device only.\n\n[Discuss this material](https://www.mrwallcover.com/contact/?intent=source&service=wallcovering&topic=material%3Aacoustic) [I already have it](https://www.mrwallcover.com/contact/?intent=install&service=wallcovering&topic=material%3Aacoustic)\n\n[How we install it](https://www.mrwallcover.com/services/acoustic-wallcovering-installation/)\n\nInstallation experience\n\n## On the record\n\nAt [an office in Holborn](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/#record-an-office-in-holborn-2020) in 2020: sound-absorbent acoustic felt wallcovering on a boardroom wall, wrapped around free-standing columns and on a feature wall in an open-plan office.\n\nIn 2018 we installed an Elitis wallcovering in a private cinema room in Mayfair. Its acoustic performance depends on the specified system and its data.\n\n[Acoustic wallcovering installation](https://www.mrwallcover.com/services/acoustic-wallcovering-installation/) explains the adhesive, trimming and edges, and how junctions with other finishes are planned.\n\nPlan the detail\n\n## Useful reading\n\n- [Designer checklist](https://www.mrwallcover.com/advice/designer-specification-checklist/)\n- [Developer package](https://www.mrwallcover.com/advice/developer-wallcovering-package/)\n\nFrom our projects\n\n## Selected work\n\n- [Brown's Hotel, Mayfair](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/browns-hotel-mayfair/)\n- [Raffles London at The OWO, Whitehall](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/raffles-london-the-owo/)\n- [Four Seasons Hotel London at Ten Trinity Square](https://www.mrwallcover.com/projects/four-seasons-ten-trinity-square/)\n\nAcoustic wallcoverings: send a short note about the room, or tell us you already have the material.\n\n[Discuss this material](https://www.mrwallcover.com/contact/?intent=source&service=wallcovering&topic=material%3Aacoustic) [I already have it](https://www.mrwallcover.com/contact/?intent=install&service=wallcovering&topic=material%3Aacoustic)\n\n[How we install acoustic wallcoverings](https://www.mrwallcover.com/services/acoustic-wallcovering-installation/)\n\nBy [Dorin Burcus](https://www.mrwallcover.com/about/#dorin), founder · Last reviewed 9 October 2026\n",
